<title>USA: Work Recovery Inc reorganization approved.</title>
<headline>Work Recovery Inc reorganization approved.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Work Recovery Inc said Tuesday its amended plan of reorganization has been approved by the U.S. Bankruptcy Court for the District of Arizona.</p>
<p>The plan will allow the firm to restructure its pre-petition debt and continue operations without court supervision. The company said in a statement it expects to emmerge from Chapter 11 on February 1 and plans to apply for listing with a major stock exchange.</p>
<p>Work Recovery makes products for the evaluation of injured workers.</p>
</text>
